<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Caterpillar downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Caterpillar downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer and Co analyst Charles Harris said he downgraded Caterpillar Inc to underperform from market perform.</p>
<p>-- He cited the stock's valuation.</p>
<p>-- Said the company's sales continue to flatten while expenses continue to rise.</p>
<p>-- Said it will be difficult for the company to maintain the earnings and cash flow streams that it did last year.</p>
<p>--  He did not change earnings estimates.</p>
</text>
